        <mxCell id="0MuD8L05ND1MabVz-G4Q-10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;fontSize=15;fontFamily=Lucida Console;" value="$$ z^2&amp;nbsp; = z \cdot z^* = (\alpha + j \space 2 \pi f) \cdot (\alpha - j \space 2 \pi f&amp;nbsp;) \space \Rightarrow \\ \\ z^2&amp;nbsp; = \alpha^2&amp;nbsp; - j \space 2 \pi f \space \alpha + j \space 2 \pi f \space \alpha&amp;nbsp; - (j \space 2 \pi f)^2&amp;nbsp; \space \Rightarrow \\ \\ z^2&amp;nbsp; =&amp;nbsp; \alpha^2&amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp;j^2 \space (2 \pi f)^2&amp;nbsp; \space \Rightarrow \\ \\ z^2&amp;nbsp; =&amp;nbsp; \alpha^2&amp;nbsp; - (-1) \space (2 \pi f)^2 \space \Rightarrow \\ \\ z^2&amp;nbsp; =&amp;nbsp; \alpha^2 + (2 \pi f)^2&amp;nbsp; \space \Rightarrow \\ \\&amp;nbsp; |z| = \sqrt{ \alpha^2 + (2 \pi f)^2}$$" vertex="1">
